### Get all restaurants projections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### Get a restaurant with its details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants/6d488e14-cc5e-4565-a69e-d6cf2ee7b0d7
Accept: application/json

### Filter restaurants by cuisine and price
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants/filter?cuisine=Italian&priceRange=Regular
Accept: application/json

### Filter dishes with tags and type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/dishes/6d488e14-cc5e-4565-a69e-d6cf2ee7b0d7/filter?type=&tags=gluten
Accept: application/json

### Get vegan desserts sorted by name descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/dishes/6d488e14-cc5e-4565-a69e-d6cf2ee7b0d7/filter?type=main&tags=&sortBy=name&direction=desc
Accept: application/json

### Add a dish to a basket
PATCH  http://localhost:8080/api/orders/basket/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "menuId": "b30e7950-bb00-4188-888a-4928e336167d",
  "dishId": "2074cadd-cde6-48c3-88f6-cab5fb90eec4",
  "restaurantId": "6d488e14-cc5e-4565-a69e-d6cf2ee7b0d7",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Remove dish from a basket
PATCH  http://localhost:8080/api/orders/basket/9bfc2e5d-0835-4686-be7b-60da2c9ff6ce/removeItem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuId": "b30e7950-bb00-4188-888a-4928e336167d",
  "dishId": "19d03512-0e1a-47f9-ae06-fa8dac60f5cb"
}

### Checkout Basket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/basket/d1a00d9b-636d-4d59-8e98-2e63b576ccd6/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Casadesus",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "street": "Gijselsstraat",
  "postalCode": "2140",
  "number": 31,
  "city": "Antwerp",
  "country": "Belgium"
}

### Get Basket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/basket/c7aebe9e-d6fe-42b3-8017-795c02b88c61
Accept: application/json


### Get Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payment?orderId=c3c04282-ac76-4a23-8db7-8d98ce373769
Accept: application/json

### Verify payment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payment/verify?sessionId=cs_test_a1zSThc1JLThViqPoST0rmnevxHpCL3jEUsHDXWZHQ8iufJ9ZGRQbEKLKo&orderId=fccbb384-73fb-460c-ae7c-4aed89a2789e
Accept: application/json


### Get order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/fccbb384-73fb-460c-ae7c-4aed89a2789e
Accept: application/json
